## 🧪 项目简介 / About

`[pet]`medicine 是一款实验性的、哲学驱动的、粉末含量突破物理极限的虚构 AI 宠物护理产品。
`[pet]`medicine is an experimental, philosophy-driven, fictional AI pet-care product with powder content that exceeds the limits of physics.

本项目旨在探索 AI、依赖地狱、区块链、存在主义与猫咪之间的复杂关系。
This project explores the complex relationships between AI, dependency hell, blockchain, existentialism, and cats.

**本仓库目前只有一个 `README.md`，没有实际实现上述功能的程序代码。**
**This repository currently contains only a `README.md`, with no program code implementing the features described below.**

这不是 Bug。这是 Feature。这也是作者不需要维护代码的原因。
This is not a bug. It's a feature. It's also why the author doesn't have to maintain any code.

