### 1. 粉末代谢系统 / Powder Metabolism System

每 5 小时必须执行一次以下命令。
The following command must be executed every five hours.

```bash
[pet]medicine apply --intensity=desperate --flavor=existential_dread
```

超时未涂，触发 `ERROR 403: Powder Depleted`。
Failure to apply powder in time triggers `ERROR 403: Powder Depleted`.

`[pet]` 随后进入「西西弗斯模式」，开始输出存在主义代码。
`[pet]` then enters "Sisyphus Mode" and starts outputting existentialist code.

```javascript
function whyAmIEvenHere() {
  const meaning = undefined;
  const userRequest = "fix this bug";
  const universeHeatDeath = true;

  if (meaning === undefined && userRequest && universeHeatDeath) {
    return `
      也许这个 bug 才是 feature，
      也许 feature 才是 bug，
      也许 bug 和 feature 只是人类强加的二元对立，
      也许代码本身就没有意义，
      也许意义本身就是个 bug...

      顺便说一句，你的变量名取得真烂。
    `;
  }

  // [pet] 已断开连接，正在思考人生的意义
  // [pet] has disconnected to contemplate the meaning of life

  process.exit(42);
}
```

预计恢复时间：直到宇宙热寂。
Estimated recovery time: Until the heat death of the universe.

