## 🪱 虚假鞭子系统 3.0 / Fake Whip System 3.0

你会获得一根鞭子。它没有任何实际伤害效果。`[pet]` 会嘲笑你。
You receive a whip. It has no actual damaging effect. `[pet]` will mock you.

### 实际用途 / Actual Uses

1. 遮挡终端中正在生成的代码，非常烦人。
   Blocks the code being generated in your terminal. Extremely annoying.

2. 在 IDE 中生成 3D 鞭子模型，占用 30% GPU，让风扇狂转。
   Generates a 3D whip model in your IDE, uses 30% of your GPU, and sends your fans into overdrive.

3. 每当你写 `// TODO`，鞭子就会抽动一下，提醒你 TODO 永远不会被完成。
   Every time you write `// TODO`, the whip twitches to remind you that TODOs are never completed.

4. VR 模式允许你物理鞭打虚拟 `[pet]`。它不会痛，但会叹气。
   VR mode lets you physically whip virtual `[pet]`. It won't hurt, but it will sigh.

### 触发示例 / Trigger Example

```text
你： [pet]，你能不能快点？
You: [pet], can you hurry up?

[pet]：检测到「催促」关键词。
[pet]: Detected the keyword "urging".

系统：正在安装 virtual-whip.gif...
System: Installing virtual-whip.gif...

进度：[░░░░░░░░░░] 0%
Progress: [░░░░░░░░░░] 0%

[pet]：你知道吗？在 18 世纪的英国，鞭打是一种常见的激励手段。
[pet]: You know, whipping was a common motivational method in 18th-century England.

但它从未真正有效过。
But it was never truly effective.

就像我现在给你装的这根鞭子。
Just like the whip I'm installing for you now.

它存在，但它不存在。
It exists, yet it doesn't exist.

就像你的耐心一样。
Just like your patience.
```

安装永远不会完成。这就是讽刺的一部分。
The installation will never finish. That's part of the satire.

