## 📦 实体货物与订阅计划 / Physical Goods and Subscription Plans

所有套餐均为虚构设定。这里没有真实的订阅服务，也不会自动寄出粉末。
All plans are fictional concepts. No actual subscription service exists, and no powder will be shipped automatically.

